#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c.i. Prepare template circuit by using `samplex` {#ci-prepare-template-"
"circuit-by-using-samplex}"
msgstr ""
"c.i. Preparar o circuito de modelo usando `samplex` {#ci-prepare-template-"
